V27_2 rules from nixos-m4pro docs/gpu/driver-27.2-diff.md (items 2, 3, 5):
the A18 Pro queue pointer layout, opening opcode 0x15, and the 27.2
MainConfig (power_config_va at +0x481: the firmware wrote through +0x481
and faulted at 0x930; no unk_18 page; macOS's +0x308..+0x328 words).

